site URL: https://himstar.himelectronics.com/\nFacebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/himelectronics\nInstagram Page: https://www.instagram.com/himstarnepal/\n\nHimstar Products are available in EMI (Easy Monthly Installment).\nTo Apply for EMI: https://himelectronics.com/EMI\n\nHimstar products are available in exchange through Arkostore.\nTo exchange visit: https://www.arkostore.com/\n\nFor any queries, contact us @:\nToll-Free No.: 1660-01-88088\nPhone no: 01-5970705\nEmail: info.him@golchhagroup.com.np\n\nHave you had a great experience with Himstar Products? Let us know in the comments below!\n\nAbout Us:\nHim Electronics Pvt. Ltd. is an Electronics \u0026 Electricals company dedicated to delivering quality products in the Nepali market. Learn more about Him Electronics at https://www.himelectronics.com/\n\n#himstar #refrigerator #stylish #spacious #summertime #fridge","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CmDDHcq-9Sk/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwE8CKgBEF5IWvKriqkDLwgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AfABAfgB_gmAAtAFigIMCAAQARhyIGUoKDAP\u0026rs=AOn4CLD7YC1S0bbGfPd2us9kFu4AwvFx9Q","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CmDDHcq-9Sk/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwE8CMQBEG5IWvKriqkDLwgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AfABAfgB_gmAAtAFigIMCAAQARhyIGUoKDAP\u0026rs=AOn4CLC5-qLTLGiQJabspSKRGAZqnM26_Q","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CmDDHcq-9Sk/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwE9CPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAy8IARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAHwAQH4Af4JgALQBYoCDAgAEAEYciBlKCgwDw==\u0026rs=AOn4CLCnsFk7SmI-cxNYnC6VV4Ab_4yEIA","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CmDDHcq-9Sk/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwE9CNACELwBSFryq4qpAy8IARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAHwAQH4Af4JgALQBYoCDAgAEAEYciBlKCgwDw==\u0026rs=AOn4CLAvVFdQS5prUUsgweiNeS9hns6QZQ","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CmDDHcq-9Sk/maxresdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAKENAF8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGHIgZSgoMA8=\u0026rs=AOn4CLB0L3Pb28il69lirMlz6L5IevvRMQ","width":1