liters.\n\nConnect with us through:\nWebsite URL: https://himstar.himelectronics.com/\nFacebook Page:   / himelectronics  \nInstagram Page:   / himstarnepal  \n\nHimstar Products are available in EMI (Easy Monthly Installment).\nTo Apply for EMI: https://himelectronics.com/EMI\n\nHimstar products are available in exchange through Arkostore.\nTo exchange visit: https://www.arkostore.com/\n\nFor any queries, contact us @:\nToll-Free No.: 1660-01-88088\nPhone no: 01-5970705\nEmail: info.him@golchhagroup.com.np\n\nHave you had a great experience with Himstar Products? Let us know in the comments below!\n\nAbout Us:\nHim Electronics Pvt. Ltd. is an Electronics \u0026 Electricals company dedicated to delivering quality products in the Nepali market. Learn more about Him Electronics at https://www.himelectronics.com/\n\n#himstar #refrigerator #stylish #spacious #summertime #fridge","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":480,"length":35,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CLoBEM2rARgBIhMIjMKetYCklgMVkUadCR1lZBbnSKnq-9Xc47CwCsoBBCQlk9w=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVB0cEczVjJxeHBvaG9hOGh3X1BnNnxBR3JiS2FrRW1XY1NBMFRMOU1lcmZ1OEVUaURCZFdySWdRZ0paUnc2ZkVMRENGWExmTlRnNGpUeW82RWtoRm1xdmJiYUNtX1owendSaXRwTjdnRXBMZ2ZXUjBjNmNIMy1XTzh6\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhimstar.himelectronics.com%2F\u0026v=CmDDHcq-9Sk","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVB0cEczVjJxeHBvaG9hOGh3X1BnNnxBR3JiS2FrRW1XY1NBMFRMOU1lcmZ1OEVUaURCZFdySWdRZ0paUnc2ZkVMRENGWExmTlRnNGpUeW82RWtoRm1xdmJiYUNtX1owendSaXRwTjdnRXBMZ2ZXUjBjNmNIMy1XTzh6\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhimstar.himelectronics.com%2F\u0026v=CmDDHcq-9Sk","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":531,"length":20,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CLoBEM2rARgBIhMIjMKetYCklgMVkUadCR1lZBbnSKnq-9Xc47CwCsoBB